---
import Base from '@/layouts/Base.astro';

const title = 'Card & Perks — Sorted';
const description = 'The Sorted card turns your balance into everyday money. Tap to pay anywhere Mastercard works, and earn Sorted Points while you do it.';
---

<Base title={title} description={description} active="card">
<section class="subhero dotgrid">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="crumbs"><a href="/">Sorted</a><span class="sep"></span><span>The app</span><span class="sep"></span><span>Card & Perks</span></div>
    <span class="subhero-eyebrow">The app · Card & Perks</span>
    <h1>Your money, <span class="hl">everywhere.</span></h1>
    <p class="subhero-sub">The Sorted card turns your balance into everyday money. Tap your phone or the card anywhere Mastercard works. <strong>No monthly fee. No hoops.</strong></p>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section reveal"><div class="container">
    <div class="two-col">
      <div>
        <h2 class="section-title" style="text-align:left;font-size:48px;">Money you can actually use.</h2>
        <p style="font-size:18px;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-bottom:18px;">A balance that can only move inside one app isn't really money — it's store credit. The Sorted card fixes that. The cafe, the servo, the big shop, online: anywhere Mastercard is accepted, your Sorted balance pays.</p>
        <p style="font-size:18px;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-bottom:18px;">Tap your phone or the physical card. It pulls straight from your balance — no top-up shuffle, no "transfer to card" step, no waiting for anything to clear.</p>
        <p style="font-size:18px;color:var(--ink-soft);">Misplaced it? Freeze the card from the app in one tap. Found it down the back of the couch? Unfreeze just as fast.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="info-card lime">
          <div class="info-card-eyebrow" style="color:var(--ink-soft);">Every tap counts</div>
          <h3 class="info-card-title">Sorted Points, for doing normal stuff</h3>
          <p style="font-size:16px;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-top:14px;line-height:1.6;">Send to a mate. Tap for a coffee. Refer a friend. Points stack up for the things you were doing anyway — and unlock perks at local Aussie businesses.</p>
          <p style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0.04em;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-top:16px;">Points come from what you do — never from how much you hold. No purchase-this, no maintain-that.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div></div></section><section class="section alt reveal"><div class="container">
    <div class="section-head"><span class="section-eyebrow">The honest list</span><h2 class="section-title">No monthly fee. <span class="hl">No hoops.</span></h2></div>
    <div class="prose">
      <ul>
        <li><strong>No monthly or annual fee.</strong> The card comes with the app. That's it.</li>
        <li><strong>No fee to tap in Australia.</strong> Coffee costs what the menu says.</li>
        <li><strong>Straight from your balance.</strong> No separate card account, no "load your card" ritual. One balance, every use.</li>
        <li><strong>Freeze and unfreeze instantly.</strong> From the app, in one tap, any hour.</li>
        <li><strong>Tap from your phone or the card.</strong> Whichever's closer.</li>
        <li><strong>Sorted Points on every tap.</strong> Doing the groceries quietly stacks perks.</li>
        <li><strong>No surprises overseas.</strong> Any overseas usage costs will be published plainly before launch — on the screen, not in a PDF.</li>
      </ul>
    </div></div></section><section class="section reveal"><div class="container">
    <div class="prose">
      <h2>What about Sorted Perks?</h2>
      <p>Sorted Points unlock perks at local Aussie businesses — the cafe shout, the local pub, the bakery that does the good pies. We're building the network now, starting close to home. Details closer to launch.</p>
      <h2>When can I get it?</h2>
      <p>The card rolls out with launch. Claim your handle now — early handles are first in the card queue, and founding members start with bonus Sorted Points.</p>
      <h2>Will my balance ever earn anything?</h2>
      <p>Not right now — and we won't pretend otherwise. Down the track we're exploring ways to make idle balances do more, subject to the right regulatory settings. No promises, no fine print. Today the deal is simple: free sends to mates, the Sorted card, and Sorted Points for doing normal stuff.</p>
    </div></div></section>
<section class="page-cta">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="page-cta-inner reveal">
      <h2 class="page-cta-title">Tap in.</h2>
      <p class="page-cta-sub">Claim your @handle — the card rolls out with launch, and early handles go first.</p>
      <div class="page-cta-actions">
        <a data-claim href="#" class="btn btn-dark btn-lg">Claim your handle <svg class="icon"><use href="#i-arrow-right"/></svg></a>
        <a href="/how-it-works" class="btn btn-secondary btn-lg">How it works</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
</Base>
